\title "Sailor's Hornpipe"
\subtitle "Traditional · tenor banjo (Jazz CGDA)"
\copyright "Traditional public-domain melody (sailor's dance tune, late 18th century). Arrangement under MIT or Apache-2.0."
\tempo 140
\tuning A3 D3 G2 C2
.
// A Part — quick descending opening "dee-dee-dee-dee, dee-dee-dee-dee"
:8 0.1 2.1 0.1 0.2 | 2.2 0.2 0.1 2.1 |
:8 0.1 0.2 2.2 0.2 | 0.3 2.3 0.2 r |
// A Part second half
:8 0.1 2.1 0.1 0.2 | 2.2 0.2 0.1 2.1 |
:8 0.1 0.2 2.2 0.3 | 0.3 0.3 0.3 r |
// B Part — upper register
:8 3.1 2.1 0.1 2.1 | 3.1 0.1 2.1 0.1 |
:8 0.2 2.2 0.2 2.2 | 3.2 0.2 2.2 0.2 |
// B Part second half — resolve
:8 3.1 2.1 0.1 2.1 | 3.1 0.1 0.2 2.2 |
:8 0.2 0.3 2.3 0.3 | 0.3 0.3 0.3 r |
